     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provincial Capacity Buidling Programme (PCaB) continues to support the Department of Finance (DoF) and through the project PCaB successfully rolled out IFMS in 13 provinces and 8 Provincial Health Authorities (PHA). This is a critical requirement under the PNG Public Finance Managment Act. The 13 provinces are East New Britain (ENB), West New Britain (WNB), Central, Oro, East Sepik, Jiwaka, Simbu, Madang, NCD, Manus, Eastern Highlands, Western Highlands and New Ireland</narrative>
